ng to address the  immediate needs that our children need  which is lower class size we need  teachers and classrooms  that are delivered in a high quality  curriculum you can be at a large school  system you can be a medium size you can  be at a large size school system those  the root cause is still going to be  there  dr jarrow also pointing out that the  last time they started an academic year  fully staffed was back in 1994.
 

